{"id":"n71908-1-9","stage":3,"title":"이만 · 到此为止","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71908-1-9-1","ko":"곧 해가 질 것 같아. 이만 돌아가는 게 좋겠어.","zh":"太阳快落山了，该回去了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"곧","meaning":"就，马上，即将","explanation":"곧：就，马上，即将","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"2","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}},{"text":"해가","meaning":"太阳","explanation":"해：太阳；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72468","senseId":"1","lemma":"해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해가","audio":"/audio/b47f44201b814682f91a.mp3"}},{"text":"질","meaning":"落","explanation":"지다：落；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62496","senseId":"1","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"질","audio":"/audio/f8e3ebf962cde8a810e8.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}},{"text":"이만","meaning":"到此为止","explanation":"이만：到此为止","readings":[{"term":"이만","audio":"/audio/02edd343f9eb4851da7e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71908","senseId":"1","lemma":"이만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이만","audio":"/audio/02edd343f9eb4851da7e.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아가는","meaning":"回去","explanation":"돌아가다：返回、回去；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"8","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌아가는","audio":"/audio/e6aaf9069ca85c8eb709.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"这件事（것 + 이）","explanation":"것：前面所说的行为、状态或事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"좋겠어.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋겠어","audio":"/audio/3b128c5b8414727d9531.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"就，马上，即将","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"时间没过多久。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"b4ec4274b7799f1f","term":"해","zh":"太阳","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3","entryId":"72468","definition":"位于太阳系的中心，温度极高，自行发光的恒星。","pronunciation":["해"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"落","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"62496","definition":"太阳或月亮西下。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；前面所说的行为、状态或事情","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"02edd343f9eb4851","term":"이만","zh":"到此为止","audio":"/audio/02edd343f9eb4851da7e.mp3","entryId":"71908","definition":"到这个程度就结束或停止。","pronunciation":["이만"]},{"id":"1152d7a56fb1600a","term":"돌아가다","zh":"返回、回去","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3","entryId":"74103","definition":"返回、回去","pronunciation":["도라가다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/5f148f252c2ebfbcbc62.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71908-1-9-2","ko":"그래, 어두워지면 무서우니까 이제 집에 가자.","zh":"好，天黑了会害怕，我们现在回家吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래,","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"어두워지면","meaning":"暗，黑暗；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"어둡다：暗，黑暗；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"어둡다","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89860","senseId":"1","lemma":"어둡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어두워지면","audio":"/audio/d4fe3fae3177a96a6475.mp3"}},{"text":"무서우니까","meaning":"怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧","explanation":"무섭다：怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"무섭다","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55637","senseId":"1","lemma":"무섭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무서우니까","audio":"/audio/b71f8cbf5e97f075313d.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"가자.","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가자","audio":"/audio/9d6a16e0f490c47dce42.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"ced8d3736f75b7c3","term":"어둡다","zh":"暗，黑暗","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3","entryId":"89860","definition":"没有光或光线很弱而不亮。","pronunciation":["어둡따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"6c5692ebced898c0","term":"무섭다","zh":"怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3","entryId":"55637","definition":"忌讳某个对象或担心出什么事。","pronunciation":["무섭따"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"今后","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"61172","definition":"从今以后。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a9a150c4732ac4d3c607.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.179,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.